WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.682
Hi, Drew.
(audience applaud)

2
00:00:01.682 --> 00:00:04.370
Hello, how are you?

3
00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.810
I am good,

4
00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.500
and thank you so much for that introduction.

5
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.210
Oh, well,

6
00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.730
you know, it's funny,

7
00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.960
I was reading about how

8
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:17.390
the word and nickname "Sunshine Girl"

9
00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:19.730
was something given to you by your mom,

10
00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.730
