33
00:01:21.507 --> 00:01:23.467
"this isn't working for me,

34
00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:25.440
"it's "Sunshine Girl", an unexpected life."

35
00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:30.380
Because truly I came from such a crazy life of chaos

36
00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.590
