37
00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:33.550
where I was gonna live,

38
00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:34.383
what country,

39
00:01:34.383 --> 00:01:36.840
what language I would be speaking,

40
00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:39.460
what boyfriends my mother would be having.

41
00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.330
That an unexpected life

42
00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:46.330
is truly the moment I'm living in now.

43
00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:49.030
I'm just gonna straight up say

44
00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:53.160
that I relate to a lot of areas of your life,

45
00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:57.560
and I grew up too never knowing where I was gonna be next.

46
00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:01.470
Why do you think that that made you adaptable?

47
00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:04.260
Do you think that it made you

48
00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:08.790
