79
00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.810
oh, I don't have to carry that baggage anymore,

80
00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:27.013
I can actually make my own life now.

81
00:03:28.115 --> 00:03:29.850
They can be a part of where I got to

82
00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:32.950
