83
00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:35.550
I think the generations are so different too,

84
00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:38.840
like my mom, and we just had the oddest dynamic,

85
00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:42.340
no parent-child dynamic, really just two equals.

86
00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:44.910
I saw this as like chaplain and the kid.

87
00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.790
And we were just kinda, always like making our way

88
00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:48.810 line:15%
and doing our thing,

89
00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:49.660 line:15%
and mmmm,

90
00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.960 line:15%
and there was no parent-child dynamic.

91
00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:55.830 line:15%
But I don't think in the 50s, 60s, 70s,

92
00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:58.380
