95
00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:06.490
and the expectations in society are just so different.

96
00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:09.350
I mean, women like smoked and drank when they were pregnant,

97
00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:11.370
and now you can't eat deli meats,

98
00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:14.830
it's like, it's a very different time, you know?

99
00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:16.260
I mean-
You have a great point,

100
00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:17.320
That's a great point Drew

101
00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:19.710
and you're absolutely right it was a very different time.

102
00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:21.900
Yeah. I want my girls to...

103
00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:24.530
I'd like them to go travel by themselves,

104
00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.160
which, you know, scares me as a parent,

105
00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.300
